:= talk
[if story_is("Prologue(Start)")]
    => first_meeting
[elif story_is("Prologue(MetSprite)")]
    => needs_help
[else]
    => chatter
---

:= first_meeting
Flame Sprite: So cold...
Flame Sprite: The flame...?
>> update_main_story("Prologue(MetSprite)")
---

:= needs_help
Flame Sprite: Can you help me...?
Flame Sprite: The flame... Need heat.
---

:= chatter
Flame Sprite: You're still here..?
---
